          "needs": ["python", "a YouTube browser login exported by tool:export-browser-login-cookies-for-yt-dlp", "a plan the person has read"],
          "say": "This publishes playlists on the person's channels, so show them SORT-PLAN.md and ask before running it; held-back and low-confidence videos are marked there. Run it from the root of the Workshop checkout with one JSON request file named where {request} is. Try one playlist first with limit_playlists 1 or only_title. Read the last line: { result } names each playlist and how many videos were added now; { error } says what to change. Then run do-work/verify_sort.py with {cookies, plan_file, applied_file, accounts_dir} and show the person INDEX.md and any problems."
